      "source": [
        "---\n",
        "title: \"Contacto y Cotizaciones\"\n",
        "subtitle: \"Inicie la transformación analítica de su equipo u organización\"\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.grid}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-7}\n",
        "::: {.card-service}\n",
        "### Solicite una Cotización o Diagnóstico Gratuito\n",
        "\n",
        "Complete el formulario y uno de nuestros socios consultores se pondrá en contacto en menos de 24 horas.\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "```{html}\n",
        "<form action=\"[https://formspree.io/f/xbjnqweq](https://formspree.io/f/xbjnqweq)\" method=\"POST\">\n",
        "  <label for=\"name\"><strong>Nombre Completo:</strong></label>\n",
        "  <input type=\"text\" id=\"name\" name=\"name\" class=\"form-control-custom\" placeholder=\"Ej. Juan Pérez\" required>\n",
        "\n",
        "  <label for=\"email\"><strong>Correo Corporativo:</strong></label>\n",
        "  <input type=\"email\" id=\"email\" name=\"email\" class=\"form-control-custom\" placeholder=\"ejemplo@empresa.com\" required>\n",
        "\n",
        "  <label for=\"company\"><strong>Empresa / Organización:</strong></label>\n",
        "  <input type=\"text\" id=\"company\" name=\"company\" class=\"form-control-custom\" placeholder=\"Nombre de su empresa\">\n",
        "\n",
        "  <label for=\"service\"><strong>Servicio de Interés:</strong></label>\n",
        "  <select id=\"service\" name=\"service\" class=\"form-control-custom\">\n",
        "    <option value=\"training-powerbi\">Capacitación: Power BI Corporativo</option>\n",
        "    <option value=\"training-r-python\">Capacitación: R o Python para Data Science</option>\n",
        "    <option value=\"training-sql\">Capacitación: SQL Avanzado</option>\n",
        "    <option value=\"consulting-dashboards\">Consultoría: Desarrollo de Dashboards (Shiny/Power BI)</option>\n",
        "    <option value=\"consulting-predictive\">Consultoría: Modelado Predictivo / Automatización</option>\n",
        "    <option value=\"otro\">Otro Requerimiento Especial</option>\n",
        "  </select>\n",
        "\n",
        "  <label for=\"message\"><strong>Detalle de su solicitud:</strong></label>\n",
        "  <textarea id=\"message\" name=\"message\" rows=\"4\" class=\"form-control-custom\" placeholder=\"Describa brevemente lo que necesita su equipo...\" required></textarea>\n",
        "\n",
        "  <button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn-primary-custom\" style=\"width: 100%;\">Enviar Mensaje de Cotización</button>\n",
        "</form>\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.g-col-12 .g-col-md-5}\n",
        "::: {.card-service style=\"background: #f8fafc;\"}\n",
        "### Datos de Contacto Directo\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Razón Social:**  \n",
        "  Analytics360 Consulting & Training S.A.C.\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Correo Corporativo:**  \n",
        "  [contacto@analytics360.pe](mailto:contacto@analytics360.pe)\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Red Profesional:**  \n",
        "  [LinkedIn de Analytics360](https://www.linkedin.com)\n",
        "\n",
        "* **Horario de Atención:**  \n",
        "  Lunes a Viernes: 8:00 - 18:00 hrs.\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "#### Modalidad de Servicio\n",
        "* **Capacitaciones:** Virtuales en vivo a nivel nacional e internacional, y presenciales *In-House*.\n",
        "* **Consultoría:** Despliegue en servidores del cliente o en la nube.\n",
        ":::\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        ":::"
